<season>
  <plot>**[East Blue Saga]**

Luffy and the gang thought they were just stopping in for a quick bite... but now Luffy's been made a busboy on Baratie, the oceangoing restaurant, and it turns out some of the worst-mannered pirates on the Grand Line are just dying for a meal. Always one to look on the bright side, Luffy sets his sights on Sanji, the smart-talking, skirt-chasing assistant chef on the Baratie, as the Going Merry's new cook. But it'll take more than a vicious pirate battle and a little sweet talking from Nami to convince him to leave the Baratie and join Luffy's team: his oath to feed any and all pirates in need keeps getting in the way! The question is: what do you do when the very same pirates you just fed now want to serve you up for dinner?</plot>
